      },
      {
        "block_id": "doxcnBnvDPT1ELa35NTwoAx3Dkf",
        "block_type": 2,
        "parent_id": "GrPvddjcqoDeM5xzWeDcdGDcnUf",
        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "1. ",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "示范效应显著推高跟风模仿率，但真突破成功率发生断崖式暴跌",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "background_color": 3,
                  "bold": true,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "。2026 年 7 月以来的实证表明，在高标断板后尝试高位横盘压单绕异动的比例，从阶段 1 的 50.0% 飙升至阶段 3 的 59.1%；然而二波真突破成功率却从阶段 2 的 75.0% 骤降至阶段 3 的 69.2%。",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "block_id": "doxcnfnrRM8CIYRyTP5efXJglIc",
        "block_type": 2,
        "parent_id": "GrPvddjcqoDeM5xzWeDcdGDcnUf",
        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "2. ",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "模仿跟风期介入横盘标的的盈亏比彻底崩塌",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "background_color": 3,
                  "bold": true,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "。阶段 2 在破局龙头新华传媒与九阳股份确立后，D2 介入持有 5 日平均收益高达 +-5.03%，胜率 37.5%，大面率仅 50.0%；而进入阶段 3 群体模仿跟风后，5 日平均收益直接转负为 -4.84%，吃 10% 以上大面率飙升至 46.2%。",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "block_id": "doxcnqf8x8C1T4ayfVpkN8RO6Dc",
        "block_type": 2,
        "parent_id": "GrPvddjcqoDeM5xzWeDcdGDcnUf",
        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "3. ",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "12年全周期实证印证超级龙退潮定律：扩散期赚钱，拥挤期收割",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "background_color": 3,
                  "bold": true,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "。在破局大妖确立后的 1 至 15 天内，市场尚存赚钱效应（成功率 66.7%，5日均收益 +-2.21%）；一旦进入 16 至 30 天的共识拥挤期，模仿率虽维持在 40.5% 的高位，但成功率跌至 67.3%，大面率激增至 33.1%。",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "block_id": "doxcnDQia6CsGmg9660TQF8j52f",
        "block_type": 2,
        "parent_id": "GrPvddjcqoDeM5xzWeDcdGDcnUf",
        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "4. ",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "卡异动横盘是主力的被动防守，而非二波主升的充分条件",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "background_color": 3,
                  "bold": true,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "。许多伪龙头仅仅是因为散户惜售与游资压单而在高位勉强横住 3 天，一旦监管关注函下达或低位新题材爆发，高位横盘平台立即发生雪崩式补跌。",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
